# Only what the image needs is sent to the build. Listing what goes in, rather
# than what stays out, keeps a local .env, database or virtual environment out
# of the image without having to think of each one.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!mathutrice

# Runtime data and local leftovers inside the package.
mathutrice/rag_documents
**/__pycache__
**/.env*
**/*.db
